{"snippets":[{"filterText":"action","label":"action ... (typed action block)","detail":"mcpp::action with id, role, description, arg/input/output and submit","documentation":"The five roles (SPEC-007 R3.6): source, check, object, artifact, prepare.","insertText":"mcpp::action ${1:handle};\n${1:handle}.id = \"${2:id}\";\n${1:handle}.role = mcpp::roles::${3|source,check,object,artifact,prepare|};\n${1:handle}.description = \"${4:description}\";\n${1:handle}.arg(\"${5:argument}\")\n    .input(\"${6:input}\")\n    .output(\"${7:output}\")\n    .submit();"},{"filterText":"action","label":"action ... (prepare block)","detail":"mcpp::action for a prepare role; output_dir is required (SPEC-007 R3.3)","documentation":"A prepare action must declare output_dir; the engine refuses one without it.","insertText":"mcpp::action ${1:handle};\n${1:handle}.id = \"${2:id}\";\n${1:handle}.role = mcpp::roles::prepare;\n${1:handle}.output_dir(\"${3:dir}\");\n${1:handle}.command(\"${4:command}\").submit();"},{"filterText":"cxxflag","label":"cxxflag(...)","detail":"mcpp:cxxflag= · slot CxxFlags","insertText":"cxxflag(\"${1:value}\")","documentation":"SPEC-007 R2.1"},{"filterText":"cflag","label":"cflag(...)","detail":"mcpp:cflag= · slot CFlags","insertText":"cflag(\"${1:value}\")","documentation":"SPEC-007 R2.1"},{"filterText":"link_lib","label":"link_lib(...)","detail":"mcpp:link-lib= · slot LdFlags","insertText":"link_lib(\"${1:value}\")","documentation":"SPEC-007 R2.1"},{"filterText":"link_search","label":"link_search(...)","detail":"mcpp:link-search= · slot LdFlags","insertText":"link_search(\"${1:value}\")","documentation":"SPEC-007 R2.1"},{"filterText":"cfg","label":"cfg(...)","detail":"mcpp:cfg= · slot Defines","insertText":"cfg(\"${1:value}\")","documentation":"SPEC-007 R2.1"},{"filterText":"generated","label":"generated(...)","detail":"mcpp:generated= · slot Generated","insertText":"generated(\"${1:value}\")","documentation":"SPEC-007 R2.1"},{"filterText":"source","label":"source(.